  m_text: "Abilities have different delivery types\n\n\u2022 Instant abilities spawn
    on top of the enemy\n\n\u2022 Area abilities damage multiple enemies\n\n\u2022
    Ray abilities will hit everyone on the path to its target\n\nAbilities also have
    different categories\n\n     Melee: Up close with small range\n\n   \n     Magic:
    Range abilities usually from afar \n   \n   \n     Ranged: Physical damage from
    afar\n\n   \n     Support: Usually heals and buffs \n\n   \n     Utility: positioning
    and movement "
